[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Car Race]
[00:01.10]Lesson 69 | 第69课
[00:03.10]The car race | 赛车
[00:05.62]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.38]Which car was the winner in 1995? | 哪辆车赢得了1995年的比赛？
[00:18.02]There is a car race near our town every year. | 每年我们镇附近都有一场赛车比赛。
[00:24.22]In 1995, there was a very big race. | 1995年，那里举行了一场非常盛大的比赛。
[00:31.35]There were hundreds of people there. | 那里有数百人。
[00:35.51]My wife and I were at the race. | 我妻子和我在赛场。
[00:39.90]Our friends Julie and Jack were there, too. | 我们的朋友朱莉和杰克也在那里。
[00:45.34]You can see us in the crowd. | 你可以在人群中看到我们。
[00:48.66]We are standing on the left. | 我们站在左边。
[00:53.26]There were twenty cars in the race. | 比赛中有二十辆车。
[00:57.72]There were English cars, French cars, German cars, Italian cars, American cars and Japanese cars. | 有英国车、法国车、德国车、意大利车、美国车和日本车。
[01:11.27]It was an exciting finish. | 那是一个激动人心的结局。
[01:14.85]The winner was Billy Stewart. | 获胜者是比利·斯图尔特。
[01:19.35]He was in car number fifteen. | 他在15号车里。
[01:22.90]Five other cars were just behind him. | 其他五辆车紧随其后。
[01:28.34]On the way home, my wife said to me, 'Don't drive so quickly! | 在回家的路上，我妻子对我说：“别开那么快！
[01:37.26]You're not Billy Stewart!' | 你又不是比利·斯图尔特！”